Subject: [PATCH] Host window: 4:3 picture, bicubic scaling, FXAA and SMAA

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0022: Host picture at 4:3
- 0067: Runtime: bicubic scaling of the picture to the window
- 0070: Runtime: FXAA on the picture before the window scales it
- 0071: Runtime: SMAA on the picture, the default anti-aliasing
